OL,3,AMbappe dropped by major Chinese brands
OL,4,Aas backlash grows over Mao joke
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's a play on the Real Madrid
OL,7,Fforward's nickname - "the dictator" -
OL,8,Fwhich he earned because of his huge
OL,9,Finfluence in football. It has become a
OL,10,Frunning joke, and the source of many
OL,11,Fmemes involving Mbappe.
OL,13,FBut the joke did not go down well in
OL,14,FChina, where Mao is revered by the
OL,15,FCommunist Party, despite his chaotic
OL,16,Fand often violent rule that left
OL,17,Fmillions dead.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
